        <mxCell id="N1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF3CD;strokeColor=#C8A415;fontColor=#5C4708;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="Not drawn because it cannot happen: Agent runtime → Signer service — network-denied, asserted by a CI probe test." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="760" x="40" y="4160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N2" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF3CD;strokeColor=#C8A415;fontColor=#5C4708;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="After signing the intent is terminal — if settlement times out, rotate to a fresh intentId and nonce; never reuse, or two authorizations could both settle." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="760" x="840" y="4160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N3" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF3CD;strokeColor=#C8A415;fontColor=#5C4708;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="Revoke is effective within a block — the next decision fails check 1 (mandate live) with no agent↔signer coordination." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="760" x="1640" y="4160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N4" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF3CD;strokeColor=#C8A415;fontColor=#5C4708;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="Policy decision: maxCardsPerWindow = 1 — at most ONE card per window. check 6 only guards window spend and a single card; cardCount is always 0 | 1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="2400" x="40" y="4240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N5" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#E8F0FE;strokeColor=#4285F4;fontColor=#174EA6;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="Staged demo model — Stage A (test): token = TSGD (mock XSGD, same EIP-3009 interface) on Fuji 43113; merchant = mock resource server exposing BOTH x402 (402 + payment-required) and UCP (/.well-known/ucp → cart/checkout whose payment handler issues the TSGD challenge); card generation is REAL — StraitsX sandbox MCP get_card_sandbox/wallet → real cardapi URL + iframe card view; only the issuer AUTH leg is simulated (local RHA stand-in mirroring StraitsX simulate-transaction contract — approved|declined, response codes), swapped to the real simulate_transactions API when the rep provisions it. Money movement: &#39;SGD → mint TSGD&#39; (simulated on-ramp) → EIP-3009 on-chain transfer → &#39;burn TSGD → SGD&#39; (simulated redemption, 1:1); TSGD minted exactly once per purchase, burned exactly once. Stage B (production): swap TSGD → real XSGD (Avalanche 43114, 0xb2F85b7AB3c2b6f62DF06dE6aE7D09c010a5096E) — token moves buyer → merchant on-chain; the XSGD → SGD → card-issuer redemption leg is executed by StraitsX (MAS-licensed), not by us." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="3240" x="40" y="4310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N6" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#E8F0FE;strokeColor=#4285F4;fontColor=#174EA6;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="Real-time transparency + audit — the Ledger broadcasts EVERY mutation as an append-only SSE event (GET /ledger/events: snapshot on connect, then append as each step lands). The Web app proxies the stream and renders it live on the Ledger page: intent.created → challenge.attached → nonce.reserved → decision.recorded (refusals and escalations included — every outcome is visible) → settlement.recorded → spend.recorded → capture.recorded, plus policy.put and escalation events. Full history for audit = GET /intents (append-only, newest first, read-only view) and per-purchase GET /receipt/:requestId; the user sees the same records on the History page. Append-only by design: nothing is ever rewritten or deleted, only a new state appended." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="3240" x="40" y="4430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="WwGnjc5qa93_VqSgDrvF-1" parent="1" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="Done seamlessly in chat, after user has given valid product URL" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="180" x="1382" y="990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_xSBKqbxRFXzQ7aq_lP-1" parent="1" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="Can we add 1 more check that asks for user&#39;s approval (clicking button or saying keywords) bypasses agent" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="180" x="2678" y="1641" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_xSBKqbxRFXzQ7aq_lP-2" parent="1" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="To check whether it&#39;s possible for other checks to bypass the agent as well" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="180" x="2668" y="1760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_xSBKqbxRFXzQ7aq_lP-3" parent="1" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="TTL 5 mins" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="180" x="2668" y="1880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
